WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.314
You can correct or remove a test result until a user selects Approve Results.

1.2
00:00:05.314 --> 00:00:09.326
Open the service request page, and under Test Result Entries,

1.3
00:00:09.326 --> 00:00:11.668
find the card of the report.

2.1
00:00:11.668 --> 00:00:16.957
Correct a value in the box of the result, or of its component.

2.2
00:00:16.957 --> 00:00:20.871
Here, you change Platelets from 25 to 254.

3.1
00:00:20.871 --> 00:00:26.680
To remove a result, select the three-dot button beside it, then Remove observation.

3.2
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:32.203
Care greys out a saved result and shows Marked for deletion until you save.

4.1
00:00:32.203 --> 00:00:37.492
Select Save Results. Care saves the corrections and the removals in one save,

4.2
00:00:37.492 --> 00:00:42.507
shows Test results saved successfully, and collapses the report card.

5.1
00:00:42.507 --> 00:00:47.593
Select the three-dot button in the card header, then View Observation History.

5.2
00:00:47.593 --> 00:00:50.569
It lists the results marked as entered in error,

5.3
00:00:50.569 --> 00:00:53.362
each with the badge Entered in Error.
